    "detailed_description": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Damned House: The First-Person Psychological Horror Game That Challenges Your Sanity</h2></strong><br><br>Damned House is a horror game set in a spooky house. Explore the house, while trying to escape from a very hostile creature and various dangers. There will always be a constant danger of death, do you dare to explore the house and escape from it?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Around</strong></h2><br>The game takes place inside a small house where chilling events have occurred. You will have to move through the different rooms of the house in search of the keys while your head fills with memories of dead people.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609380/extras/d83c0bdc32403ad7c9cffe44736b0cb3.poster.avif?t=1707222998\" width=750 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609380/extras/d83c0bdc32403ad7c9cffe44736b0cb3.webm?t=1707222998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609380/extras/d83c0bdc32403ad7c9cffe44736b0cb3.mp4?t=1707222998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Histoy</strong></h2><br>The house is marked by a terrible past. The neighboring family was brutally murdered by strange beings and other spooky events. In each room you can encounter different and terrifying events. As a player you will relive that terrifying past while you can't stop hearing the cry of a baby. Will you run away or try to save the baby?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dark creatures</strong></h2><br>The creature that murdered the family in that house will chase you and appear to you until you go crazy. They will follow your every move and try to attack you. Why are they chasing you? What have you done? This is what you will have to discover.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609380/extras/183e13659fb1722a75b6a8332f6f664a.poster.avif?t=1707222998\" width=750 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609380/extras/183e13659fb1722a75b6a8332f6f664a.webm?t=1707222998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609380/extras/183e13659fb1722a75b6a8332f6f664a.mp4?t=1707222998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
